{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Journey of Light is a 3D, light-based puzzle game where you need to guide the light from the spotlight to a lightless orb(s), using various different objects to redirect, modify or split that light along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ puzzles across 3 difficulties to tackle, each testing you in new ways!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ gameplay objects to use to solve the puzzles, or overcome as obstacles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chill and laidback experience to enjoy, with relaxing lo-fi and satisfying sounds as you journey through each puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different environments across 2 biomes/locales to experience!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This is a free-to-play technical demo, representing a small slice of a game concept. The full experience intends to be a globe trotting adventure, with a wide range of biomes, locales and challenges to explore. We've done our best to refine and polish this demo as a small demonstration of what the full experience could look like, and we hope you enjoy playing it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4102560?t=1772122615","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102560/f779e9bd5cbc3a87e47e4cce88046e62a031d115/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772122615","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102560/9beffd2960eec8f4a4ca988e8044b882c30bfe28/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772122615","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4102560/9beffd2960eec8f4a4ca988e8044b882c30bfe28/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772122615","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4102580,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Journey of Light is a 3D, light-based puzzle game where you need to guide the light from the spotlight to a lightless orb(s), using various different objects to redirect, modify or split that light along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ puzzles across 3 difficulties to tackle, each testing you in new ways!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10+ gameplay objects to use to solve the puzzles, or overcome as obstacles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chill and laidback experience to enjoy, with relaxing lo-fi and satisfying sounds as you journey through each puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different environments across 2 biomes/locales to experience!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Developer Note</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This is a free-to-play technical demo, representing a small slice of a game concept. The full experience intends to be a globe trotting adventure, with a wide range of biomes, locales and challenges to explore. We've done our best to refine and polish this demo as a small demonstration of what the full experience could look like, and we hope you enjoy playing it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","developers":["Scroll Lock Studios"],"genres":[{"descriptio